sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Dashboard
    participant SC as Stops Controller
    participant ST as SQL table: stops
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Choose date/period and team
    UI->>SC: Request daily stop summary
    SC->>ST: Aggregate stop count and downtime
    SC->>CA: Read causes affecting TRS
    ST-->>SC: Daily stop totals
    CA-->>SC: TRS impact flags
    SC-->>UI: KPI source data
    UI->>UI: Calculate stops, downtime, TRS and analysed days
    UI-->>Admin: Show KPI cards

    alt No data or API error
        UI-->>Admin: Show neutral KPI values or error message
    end
